{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":29,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷被围"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“亚利伊勒","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"，亚利伊勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大卫安营的城啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管你年复一年地守节期，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我终必叫你受苦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必悲伤哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我面前成为一座祭坛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必安营把你团团围住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"屯兵围困你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修筑高台攻打你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必一败涂地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺在尘土中说话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你细微的声音从土中传来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像地下幽灵的声音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必从尘埃中喃喃细语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你的众仇敌必像纤细的尘埃一样消散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众多的残暴之徒必如被风刮去的糠秕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"突然，刹那之间，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华必带着雷轰、地震、巨响、旋风、暴风和烈火来临。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打、围困亚利伊勒及其堡垒的各国军队必如梦幻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如夜间的异象一样消失。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们好像饥饿的人梦中吃饭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒来仍然饥饿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像口渴的人梦中喝水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒来仍然渴得发昏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打锡安山的各国军队都必如此。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们驻足惊奇吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们自我蒙蔽，继续瞎眼吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们醉了，但不是因为酒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们东倒西歪，但不是因为烈酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华把沉睡的灵倾倒在你们身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂封住你们的眼睛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盖住你们的头。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的眼睛就是先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的头就是先见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["对你们而言，这整个启示都好像封了印的书卷。你们把书卷交给识字的人读，他会说：“我不能读，这书卷是封着的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你们把书卷交给不识字的人读，他会说：“我不识字。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主说：“这些人嘴上亲近我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们用嘴唇尊崇我，心却远离我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们敬拜我不过是遵行人定的规条。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要再次行奇妙无比的事，使他们震惊。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们智者的智慧必泯灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明哲的聪明必消失。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些向耶和华深藏计谋的人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们暗中行事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以为谁也无从看见和知晓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们颠倒是非！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"窑匠岂可被看作泥土？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受造者岂可对创造者说","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你没有造我”？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陶器怎能对陶匠说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你什么也不懂”？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"再过不久，黎巴嫩将变成沃野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沃野上庄稼将茂密如林。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，耳聋的必听见那书卷上的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盲人的眼睛必能看穿黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卑微的人必因耶和华而欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贫穷的人必因以色列的圣者而快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"残暴之徒必消失，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嘲讽者必绝迹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有伺机作恶者必被铲除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们恶言诬陷人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暗算城门口的审判官，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用谎言冤枉无辜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，关于雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救赎亚伯拉罕的耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“雅各的子孙必不再羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脸上再无惧色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们看见我赐给他们的子孙时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必尊我的名为圣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必尊雅各的圣者为圣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必敬畏以色列的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心里迷惘的必明白真理，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发怨言的必欣然受教。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"“亚利伊勒”在此处用来指锡安/耶路撒冷，2节、7节同。","reference":{"chapter":29,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}